      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-80709\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">4.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/3350#6988\">Identifying an Equation That Generates a Slope Field Using the Sign of the Slopes and Factoring</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"80709\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-80709\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>The diagram shown above is the slope field for which of the following differential equations?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 8:46 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:13</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
